*.pdf

# LaTeX print build (outputs are regenerable via latex/book-build.sh)
latex/bookbuild/
latex/cover-wrap.png
# Generated cover-wrap PNG deliverable (regenerable via latex/make-cover.sh; also built in CI)
latex/swebook-generic-cover-wrap.png
